rc> 0
out> h ran 7
out> g ran 8
out> k ran 9
out> m ran 10
out> after 1 1
err>      2 *-* call on user zx name h
err>      3 *-* call on user zy name g
err>      4 *-* call on user zw name k
err>      5 *-* call on user zv name m
